[0.092, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[9M\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mYou look across the street at the saloon. Oh wait, did you mean the prison bars? Yeah, probably.\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "Anyhow, the bars to your cell reach from floor to ceiling and are made of matte black metal. All\r\u001b[24dexcept one, which is sort of gray in color and as short as a table leg. They are a bit under an inch\u001b[25;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "thick, and they are reinforced by three tiers of horizontal bars. The gate to your cell is framed in\u001b[26;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "the same black metal and inset into this meshwork of bars.\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "In the office, the deputy looks tired.\r\u001b[30d>"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
