[0.092, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[8M\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mYou're carrying your pocketwatch and a scrap of paper. You are wearing your hat, pants, overcoat,\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "left boot, and right boot.\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "Your revolver was confiscated, it seems.\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "Back in the office, the deputy sniffles loudly and wipes his nose on his sleeve.\r\u001b[30d>"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
