[0.092, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[7M\u001b[24d\u001b[37m\u001b[40mPretty far up on the wall, as wide as your shoulders, and secured by four vertical iron rods as\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "thick as your thumb. And you have thick thumbs. The green tip of a vine pokes in from outside and\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "lies on the narrow window sill.\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "Not far from your jail cell, the bronze machine ticks like a clock.\r\u001b[30d>\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[2.413, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mr\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40me\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40ma\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
