[0.090, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40ma\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mp\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40me\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mr\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.092, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[10M\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mIn smeared scribbles: \"DEER RICK, 1. GET DYNA-MITE FROM MTNSIDE, 2. INSERT SPARKER, 3. BLOW UP\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "TUNNEL, 4. WAIT FOR ME\".\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "That was Muddy's cunning plan, and unlike most of his plans, it went off without a hitch: you got\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "the silver, nobody got hurt. Yup, not a single hitch -- except for getting caught.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "Over in the office, the deputy reaches into his pocket, produces a strip of beef jerky, and chews on\u001b[28;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "it for a while.\r\u001b[30d>\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[2.413, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mq\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mu\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40mi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
